{"sections":[{"slug":"Newton--Puiseux定理","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Newton--Puiseux定理"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Newton–Puiseux <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Newton–Puiseux 定理”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">分数次幂级数域</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">又称</span> Puiseux <span lang=\"zh\">级数域</span>)\n$$\r\nK\\left&lt;\\left&lt;X\\right&gt;\\right&gt; = \\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb{Z}_+}K((X^{1/m}))\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">是代数闭域</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">任意多项式</span> $F \\in K[X](X.md)[Y]$ <span lang=\"zh\">有分解</span> $F= \\prod (Y-\\eta_i)$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\eta_i\\in K[X^{1/m}](X^{1/m}.md)[Y]$.</p>\n"}}}]}